OL,3,GNEWSA'Fight to keep' Post Office in
OL,4,Acity after closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre Post Office is looking
OL,7,Ffor a new premises after the shop it
OL,8,Foperates from is set to close.
OL,10,FTruro Post Office is based inside the
OL,11,FTG Jones store on Pydar Street which
OL,12,Fwill close on 6 October.
OL,14,FTG Jones announced in May that up to
OL,15,F150 of its 480 High Street stores would
OL,16,Fclose as part of a restructuring plan.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
