OL,3,GNEWSA'Fight to keep' Post Office in
OL,4,Acity after closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Post Office said the vacancy for a
OL,7,Freplacement branch had been advertised
OL,8,Fand it was in the early stages of
OL,9,Freviewing the applications. Steven
OL,10,FWebb, Cornwall Councillor for the
OL,11,FMoresk and Trehaverne ward said he
OL,12,Fwould be "fighting to keep the service
OL,13,Fin the city".
